        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. Return from Leave—If the leave granted is for personal illness, the unit member will be reinstated at the conclusion of the leave providing a health certificate from the attending physician is submitted attesting to the unit member's physical fitness to perform his/her duties. Reassignment will be made when there is a vacancy for which the unit member is qualified.",
